{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112558","id":2991733676,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6yUjus","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112558","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112558.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112558.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112558","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112558/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112558/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112558/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/185220f0c7d85c3c95e0dd13b9f45a54767eb564","number":112558,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Enhance contrast on Modern theme a bit more","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> This will likely be divisive, probably rejected, but I still think it's contrast improvement we should discuss regardless.\r\n\r\nA 5% increase in contrast, bumping the main color from `#272727` to `#292929` and contrast from 0.35 to 0.37.\r\n\r\n| Current | This PR |\r\n|-|-|\r\n| ![before](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/818be21e-87e3-410f-823f-ce036c391ade) | ![after](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3b5fbbc-84b8-4ed5-8631-a24f33f319b0) |\r\n\r\nAlso tweaks some elements to avoid contrast issues (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112558#issuecomment-3507838253). There were some side effects, though, but I believe they were more positive than negative.\r\n\r\n> What I would really suggest would be `#2d2d2d`, which matches the luminance of many popular dark themes, with a contrast of 0.4, but that would distance itself too much from the original proposal and would be even more divisive.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Exaggerated variant preview (isolated as it's not part of this PR)</summary>\r\n<img alt=\"exaggerated\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/faa28a58-0298-486d-9d4f-565ea3f3434f\">\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nI made a little palette to compare colors:\r\n![contrast](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f876729f-1dd8-4dd4-a9e1-6965be81a382)\r\nFor reference, from left to right:\r\n- `#272727` (Current color)\r\n- `#292929` (Proposed color)\r\n- `#2d2d2d` (Exaggerated color)\r\n- `#3f3f3f` (Halfway point between true black and true gray, slightly brighter than Godot's Gray theme)\r\n- `#7f7f7f` (True gray)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":27